`w` reached under different packages: `kw` is still installed before `v` is
decided.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:a b

P:a
V:1
D:v

P:b
V:1
D:w

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1
D:dep

P:dep
V:1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install dep 1
install kw 1
install a 1
install b 1
install app 1
